# Where booking requests and contact messages get delivered.
# Create a free form endpoint (Formspree, Web3Forms, Getform...) that forwards to the
# owner's inbox, then paste its URL here and rename this file to .env
#
# Without it, the Book Now page falls back to a pre-filled text message to 614-483-5876
# so a request is never silently lost.
VITE_FORM_ENDPOINT=
